{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 5, :comments ["<b>And he said.</b> Yefet said that the meaning of \"many\" is: now the people are numerous in the land, so we need not worry whether plague or sword comes upon you, for they are many who bear it. In my opinion, the meaning is: you seek to bring a great labor to a halt."], :book :exodus, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 5, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["Piotrkow, 1907-1911" "https://www.nli.org.il/he/books/NNL_ALEPH990020973480205171/NLI"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T18:31:48.767617424Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}